{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15686","headline":"下第日书情寄上叔父 · 司空曙","name":"下第日书情寄上叔父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微才空觉滞京师，末学曾爲叔父知。\n雪里题诗偏见赏，林间饮酒独令随。\n游客尽伤春色老，贫居还惜暮阴移。\n欲归江海寻山去，愿报何人得桂枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}